[285.481803, "o", "documented ledger slice confusion on treasury wire cutoff failures. Operations initially attributed the drift to cache state; QA disproved that hypothesis the following morning.\r\n187: \r\n188: Platform engineer S. Patel noted that treasury wire cutoff failures webhook retries duplicated compliance messages in the investigative export, requiring deduplication by subject and sent timestamp during human review.\r\n189: \r\n190: Stakeholder workshop #778 on treasury wire cutoff failures produced conflicting recollections about which correction notice superseded an earlier owner change; Brief 04 governs that precedence for automated output.\r\n191: \r\n192: ## Email Excerpts (archived thread)\r\n\r\ncontext around 184\r\n181: \r\n182: Site visit #653 to treasury exported 20 compliance threads tied to treasury wire cutoff failures. Reviewers noted that effective-date mismatch appeared whenever correction batches straddled a weekend wire cutoff.\r\n183: \r\n184: Grant compliance WP-6364 tied treasury wire cutoff failures attestation gaps"]
[285.481825, "o", " to mailbox ingestion lag visible only when hold flags used corrected rather than pre-correction ledger dates.\r\n185: \r\n186: During February recon, S. Patel compared two cold extractor runs and documented ledger slice confusion on treasury wire cutoff failures. Operations initially attributed the drift to cache state; QA disproved that hypothesis the following morning.\r\n187: \r\n188: Platform engineer S. Patel noted that treasury wire cutoff failures webhook retries duplicated compliance messages in the investigative export, requiring deduplication by subject and sent timestamp during human review.\r\n189: \r\n190: Stakeholder workshop #778 on treasury wire cutoff failures produced conflicting recollections about which correction notice superseded an earlier owner change; Brief 04 governs that precedence for automated output.\r\n191: \r\n192: ## Email Excerpts (archived thread)\r\n193: \r\n194: Non-authoritative mailbox export kept for chronology; do not merge these rows.\r\n195: \r\n196: From: compliance@corp.internal\r\n197: Su"]
