[313.190227, "o", "788:## Policy Exceptions (draft)\r\n792:### Policy Exception\r\n797:### Policy Exception\r\n978:Exception coding review: `exception_reason` is null unless a code applies. Set\r\n979:`over_limit` when `amount_usd` strictly exceeds 10000. Set `compliance_hold`\r\n982:comparison used for `compliance_hold` is defined in Investigation Brief 09\r\n1152:Continued from Brief 07. Set `policy_waiver` when final status is `approved`,\r\n1153:`amount_usd` > 10000, and a Policy Exception block exists for that transaction\r\n1465:amendment supersedes any earlier wording about hold timing. For `compliance_hold`\r\n2891:## Policy Exceptions\r\n2893:### Policy Exception\r\n2898:### Policy Exception\r\n2903:### Policy Exception\r\n"]
