[344.162885, "o", "ative): some prototype tooling compared compliance mail timestamps against post-correction effective dates when flagging holds. Brief 09 later in this archive supersedes that draft practice for production reconciliation.\r\n569: \r\n570: Treasury liaison J. Huang explained that payroll accrual true-up related wires were paused during May journal, delaying compliance responses and amplifying status precedence inversion on rejected rows.\r\n571: \r\n572: Stakeholder workshop #718 on payroll accrual true-up produced conflicting recollections about which correction notice superseded an earlier owner change; Brief 04 governs that precedence for automated output.\r\n573: \r\n574: Data governance WP-5066 catalogs legacy HR finance folders still containing payroll accrual true-up spreadsheets. Those folders are evidentiary only; extractor output must come from canonical structured sections.\r\n575: \r\n576: SOX testing team WP-1031 linked retroactive status conflict on payroll accrual true-up to a manual override logged at 02:14 loc"]
